{"id":"16F","title":"Money","part":{"n":16,"title":"Economic and monetary laws"},"url":"/law/16-economic-and-monetary-laws/16f","entries":[{"id":"16F.1","text":"Money is to be of a standard fixed weight of a precious metal (silver, gold, etc.).","refs":[{"book":"Genesis","chapter":23,"verses":"15-16"},{"book":"Exodus","chapter":30,"verses":"13"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":22,"verses":"19"},{"book":"1 Kings","chapter":10,"verses":"14"},{"book":"2 Kings","chapter":5,"verses":"22-23"},{"book":"2 Kings","chapter":6,"verses":"25"},{"book":"Nehemiah","chapter":5,"verses":"15"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":32,"verses":"9-10"}],"citation":"Gen. 23:15-16; Exod. 30:13; Deut 22:19; 1 Kings 10: 14; 2 Kings 5:22-23; 2 Kings 6:25; Neh. 5:15; Jer. 32:9-10."},{"id":"16F.2","text":"Money (silver) is used in the sale and purchase of land and commodities.","refs":[{"book":"Genesis","chapter":23,"verses":"15-16"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":2,"verses":"6,28"},{"book":"2 Kings","chapter":4,"verses":"7"},{"book":"2 Samuel","chapter":24,"verses":"24"},{"book":"Ezra","chapter":7,"verses":"17"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":32,"verses":"9,25"},{"book":"Acts","chapter":4,"verses":"34-37"}],"citation":"Gen. 23:15-16; Deut. 2:6, 28; 2 Kings 4:7; 2 Sam. 24:24; Ezra 7:17; Jer. 32:9, 25:9, 44; Acts 4:34-37."},{"id":"16F.3","text":"Money is to be paid for work done and labor performed.","refs":[{"book":"2 Kings","chapter":12,"verses":"11-15"},{"book":"2 Kings","chapter":22,"verses":"4-6"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":24,"verses":"11-13"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":34,"verses":"9-11"},{"book":"Ezra","chapter":3,"verses":"7"}],"citation":"2 Kings 12:11-15; 2 Kings 22:4-6; 2 Chron. 24:11-13; 2 Chron. 34:9-11; Ezra 3:7."}]}